<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>mostly steady. Demand moderate. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  59.00-59.50, few 58.50 and 60.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  58.00-59.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady. Top 52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 lbs.  44.00-47.00, few 48.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs.  46.00-50.00, few 51.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs.  48.00-51.00, few 52.00</p>
</text>
